## `OVHcloud`

### Summary

| Fit | Resources |
|---|---|
| direct | 7 |
| partial | 1 |
| none | 5 |
| total | 13 |

### Resources

| ID | Raw type | Category | Fit | Best offering | Relations | Reasons |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `shop-assets` | `AWS::S3::Bucket` | `storage.object` | direct | `Object Storage` (tie: `Object Storage 3-AZ`) |  | `Object Storage` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-cdn` | `AWS::CloudFront::Distribution` | `unclassified` | none |  | depends-on `shop-assets` | not classified |
| `shop-db` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced` (tie: `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ`) |  | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-eks` | `AWS::EKS::Cluster` | `kubernetes.managed` | direct | `Managed Kubernetes Service` (tie: `Managed Kubernetes Service 3-AZ`) | depends-on `shop-db` | `Managed Kubernetes Service` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-legacy-mysql` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.mysql` | direct | `Managed MySQL Multi-node` (tie: `Managed MySQL Multi-node 3-AZ`, `Managed MySQL Multi-node Advanced`, `Managed MySQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ`) |  | `Managed MySQL Multi-node` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-orders` | `AWS::SQS::Queue` | `messaging.queue` | none |  |  | no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `messaging.queue` |
| `shop-orders-dlq` | `AWS::SQS::Queue` | `messaging.queue` | none |  | dead-letter-queue-of `shop-orders` | no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `messaging.queue` |
| `shop-thumbnailer` | `AWS::Lambda::Function` | `serverless.function` | none |  | depends-on `shop-assets` | no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function` |
| `shop-web-1` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` | depends-on `shop-orders` | `Instances` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-web-1-data` | `AWS::EC2::Volume` | `storage.block` | direct | `Block Storage` (tie: `Block Storage LUKS`) | attached-to `shop-web-1` | `Block Storage` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-web-2` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` |  | `Instances` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-web-asg` | `AWS::AutoScaling::AutoScalingGroup` | `compute.vm` | partial | `Instances` |  | `Instances` does not offer `autoscaling`; `Instances` does not offer `zone-high-availability` |
| `shop.example.com` | `AWS::Route53::HostedZone` | `unclassified` | none |  |  | not classified |

### Required changes

- `shop-web-asg`: `autoscaling`, `zone-high-availability` (not offered by `Instances`)

### Blockers

- `shop-cdn`: not classified
- `shop-orders`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `messaging.queue`
- `shop-orders-dlq`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `messaging.queue`
- `shop-thumbnailer`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function`
- `shop.example.com`: not classified
- `shop-web-1`: affected by a blocker on `shop-orders`

### Workloads

#### `media`

- Fit: 1 direct, 0 partial, 2 none
- Blockers:
  - `shop-cdn`: not classified
  - `shop-thumbnailer`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function`

#### `shop`

- Fit: 5 direct, 1 partial, 3 none
- Blockers:
  - `shop-orders`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `messaging.queue`
  - `shop-orders-dlq`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `messaging.queue`
  - `shop.example.com`: not classified

#### No workload

- Fit: 1 direct, 0 partial, 0 none
- Blockers: none

