| `shop-assets` | `AWS::S3::Bucket` | `storage.object` | direct | `Object Storage` |  | `Object Storage` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-cdn` | `AWS::CloudFront::Distribution` | `unclassified` | none |  | depends-on `shop-assets` | not classified |
| `shop-db` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.postgresql` | partial | `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL High Availability` |  | `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL High Availability` does not offer `point-in-time-restore` |
| `shop-eks` | `AWS::EKS::Cluster` | `kubernetes.managed` | direct | `Kubernetes Kapsule` (tie: `Kubernetes Kapsule Dedicated`) | depends-on `shop-db` | `Kubernetes Kapsule` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-legacy-mysql` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.mysql` | partial | `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL High Availability` |  | `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL High Availability` does not offer `point-in-time-restore` |
| `shop-orders` | `AWS::SQS::Queue` | `messaging.queue` | partial | `Queues` |  | `Queues` does not offer `encryption-at-rest` |
| `shop-orders-dlq` | `AWS::SQS::Queue` | `messaging.queue` | partial | `Queues` | dead-letter-queue-of `shop-orders` | `Queues` does not offer `encryption-at-rest` |
| `shop-thumbnailer` | `AWS::Lambda::Function` | `serverless.function` | direct | `Serverless Functions` | depends-on `shop-assets` | `Serverless Functions` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-web-1` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` | depends-on `shop-orders` | `Instances` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-web-1-data` | `AWS::EC2::Volume` | `storage.block` | direct | `Block Storage` | attached-to `shop-web-1` | `Block Storage` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-web-2` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` |  | `Instances` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-web-asg` | `AWS::AutoScaling::AutoScalingGroup` | `compute.vm` | partial | `Instances` |  | `Instances` does not offer `autoscaling`; `Instances` does not offer `zone-high-availability` |
| `shop.example.com` | `AWS::Route53::HostedZone` | `unclassified` | none |  |  | not classified |

### Required changes

- `shop-db`: `point-in-time-restore` (not offered by `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL High Availability`)
- `shop-legacy-mysql`: `point-in-time-restore` (not offered by `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL High Availability`)
- `shop-orders`: `encryption-at-rest` (not offered by `Queues`)
- `shop-orders-dlq`: `encryption-at-rest` (not offered by `Queues`)
- `shop-web-asg`: `autoscaling`, `zone-high-availability` (not offered by `Instances`)

### Blockers

